<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N = 5.10%				    O/N = 2.55%</p>
<p>	    T/N = 2.55%				    T/N = 8.94%</p>
<p>		   Sept 13, 1996			Sept 12, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  8.84%	1 month forward =  8.19%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  9.86%	2 month forward =  9.87%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward = 10.09%	3 month forward = 10.21%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward = 10.80%	4 month forward = 10.89%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward = 11.02%	5 month forward = 11.16%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward = 10.79%	6 month forward = 10.92%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
